# Linting

Configs and tooling live at monorepo root. Run from there:

```bash
pnpm check / write   # biome.json
pnpm slint           # .stylelintrc.json
pnpm typeslint       # web/tsconfig.json
pnpm tests           # vitest.config.ts (projects: web + shared)
```
